- Firebase Hosting configuration, rewrite rules, redirects, headers, caching, and multisite targets.
- Firestore security rules and indexes.
- Storage rules and indexes or access policies where applicable.
- Firebase App Check configuration and enforcement status where accessible.
- Firebase Cloud Messaging and service workers, if implemented.
- Razorpay integration, payment records, subscription lifecycle, and webhook processing, if implemented.
- Environment files, build scripts, package manifests, lockfiles, CI/CD workflows, and deployment scripts.
- SEO metadata, robots directives, sitemap generation, canonical URLs, structured data, and social sharing metadata.
- Logging, exception handling, monitoring, alerting, backups, and recovery procedures.
